            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Though, on closer inspection, these weapons aren't <i> as </i> Legendary as I'd hoped. I thought the Forge of Legends would produce peak legendariness.",
